      "Annalise does not sing in slot one.",
      "Deshawn is later than slot one in slot order.",
      "The singer who gets polite silence and slot five are exactly one slot apart in slot order, in one direction or the other.",
      "The singer who gets the landlord cutting the power falls somewhere between slot one and the singer who performs a sea shanty in slot order.",
      "Deshawn is earlier than the singer who performs a power ballad in slot order.",
      "The singer who gets a request for an encore nobody wanted and the singer who performs an eight-minute prog epic are exactly three slots apart in slot order.",
      "The singer who gets one heckler and Bogdan are exactly three slots apart in slot order. Bogdan is earlier than the singer who performs a maudlin folk song in slot order."
